    "detailed_description": "Dance Fight is a Beat 'em Up Brawler Game, Also with Cool Dance Moves !<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Single Player (Player vs AI)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Hand-to-Hand combat<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Kickboxing Style<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Enemy AI<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Several Moves<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Combos that take precise timing to execute moves<br />\r\n- For example forward/forward/Y gamepad button will perform the super punch<br />\r\n- Throw - You can pick your opponent up by the neck and slam their head into the ground<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 2.5D Side View<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Several Challenging Levels<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse WADS or Left Thumbstick to Move<br />\r\nUse JKLI (Keyboard) OR ABXY (Gamepad) to Hit/Kick<br />\r\n9 Key or Left Shoulder to Block<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Features Fun Dance Moves<br />\r\n(Use D-PAD or Arrow Keys)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* NOTE : ALL Videos &amp; Music are from Copyright Free Sources *",
